                                "example_id": "0141e402-4543-44fb-8161-2fe9321c9a77",
                                "sense_id": "4874db97-39a0-3bf5-afda-50a0eb927015",
                                "text": "Marine centric diatoms decrease in size on repeated division and eventually become smaller and smaller on successive divisions unless they reenlarge by a process involving auxospore formation."
