                                "example_id": "16acb4d2-1af7-47cd-9188-0f62440d4a71",
                                "sense_id": "4874db97-39a0-3bf5-afda-50a0eb927015",
                                "text": "Chef David Frankel indicated that: “in the new menu I went down from 250–300 grams of pasta to 120, but people complained and I had to reenlarge some portions.\""
